        "name": "Leaf Blower",
        "image": "https://www.scenexp.com/leaves/assets/og-leaves.jpg?v=1",
        "description": "A browser-based 3D leaf blower game. A front yard is buried in thousands of autumn leaves, each one simulated as it tumbles, skids and piles up. Blow them onto the tarp before the clock runs out, keep them out of the neighbor's yard, then dive into the pile. There is a no-clock mode for just playing with the leaves.",
        "genre": [
          "Casual",
          "Simulation"
        ],
        "gamePlatform": "Web browser",
        "applicationCategory": "Game",
