        "@id": "https://www.scenexp.com/tornado/#webpage",
        "url": "https://www.scenexp.com/tornado/",
        "name": "Tornado Alley",
        "description": "A passive 3D scene on the open prairie. Thirty seconds that begin on a calm summer evening, follow a tornado from its first turning to its last, and end as the storm moves on.",
        "datePublished": "2026-09-23",
